    "id": "rk_ceaaf356040e48d73c53",
    "text": "This corpus runs on a method (§1) without ever defining the underlying skill the method is an application of. This section is that definition, built from named, verifiable sources rather than the vague \"think critically\" instruction that gets repeated without content.",
